WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:35.513
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:38.463
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:42.549
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.185
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.357
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:53.307
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:58.234
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.474 --> 00:01:00.372
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.007 --> 00:01:04.871
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:08.633
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:12.065
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.505
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.040
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:23.218
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.980
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.389
♪ That unique soul was
born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.659
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.584
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.449
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:50.284
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:05.118 --> 00:02:06.171
Are you okay?

00:02:07.783 --> 00:02:08.703
It scared me to death.

00:02:16.031 --> 00:02:16.778
Mu Bai?

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.997
Xu Zhaoting? Wang Sanpang is here too?

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.301
Are you all right?

00:02:25.226 --> 00:02:27.802
These are the people that got away?

00:02:28.943 --> 00:02:31.896
You mean these are the
only survivors left.

00:02:33.561 --> 00:02:34.281
Director.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.263
It's entirely safe for us to stay here.

00:02:37.709 --> 00:02:39.627
A large horde of One-eyed Wolf Demons
are coming this way!

00:02:41.118 --> 00:02:43.605
I know, but what could we possibly do?

00:02:43.944 --> 00:02:45.478
No place is safe.

00:02:45.752 --> 00:02:47.139
This is code blood!

00:02:48.279 --> 00:02:49.826
The Capital is fallen.

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:53.962
The barrier.

00:02:54.594 --> 00:02:56.314
Bow City has a safety barrier.

00:02:57.216 --> 00:03:00.396
If we keep hiding here,
we will all die eventually.

00:03:00.802 --> 00:03:02.748
We need to get inside the barrier now!

00:03:03.503 --> 00:03:05.197
Yes, we have the barrier for protection.

00:03:05.553 --> 00:03:07.300
If we go as a large group,

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.253
we will be spotted by the monsters.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:13.312
If a large number of monsters
head to our way as we leave,

00:03:13.327 --> 00:03:14.941
all of us will die!

00:03:15.109 --> 00:03:17.443
I think the teachers
shouldn't be a problem.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.115
But with so many students
coming with us...

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:23.857
What does that mean?
It's our duty to keep them safe!

00:03:24.559 --> 00:03:26.412
We can't simply leave the students here!

00:03:27.721 --> 00:03:30.743
The city is almost lost,
we can't care so much now.

00:03:33.384 --> 00:03:37.068
I cannot just leave the students
behind and run for my life.

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:39.254
I will never do that either!

00:03:44.039 --> 00:03:47.191
We can form a pioneer team.
They will scout the way ahead,

00:03:47.259 --> 00:03:50.312
the exodus will follow their lead
and move forward.

00:03:51.289 --> 00:03:53.429
-A pioneer team?
-That sounds good.

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:56.184
Yes, we can send a team
to scout the way ahead.

00:03:56.485 --> 00:03:58.792
We don't have to wait
for the monsters to attack us.

00:03:59.512 --> 00:04:01.752
But that is a dangerous task,

00:04:02.072 --> 00:04:03.859
how do we get the volunteer?

00:04:04.404 --> 00:04:06.738
There are some talented students
in my Ace Class.

00:04:07.748 --> 00:04:09.336
Mr. Xue, I am counting on you.

00:04:09.801 --> 00:04:11.454
I'll ask for their help right away.

00:04:23.056 --> 00:04:24.150
We are short on manpower.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.180
We need to pick someone from
best students we have here.

00:04:28.065 --> 00:04:30.898
If you are not willing to join,
we won't force you.

00:04:31.519 --> 00:04:34.549
With our strength, you want us
to lead the way?

00:04:34.918 --> 00:04:38.081
I am not rushing for my death.
I should just follow the exodus.

00:04:40.521 --> 00:04:42.358
Now is the time we do something.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.190
-I will join the pioneer team.
-Me too!

00:04:45.725 --> 00:04:47.949
Xu Zhaoting, are you sure about this?

00:04:47.975 --> 00:04:48.605
Yes.

00:04:48.938 --> 00:04:50.964
Fine, I am coming with you.

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:52.549
Brother Fan, what about us?

00:04:52.575 --> 00:04:54.669
Being part of the exodus is
even more dangerous.

00:04:54.921 --> 00:04:56.695
-Why?
-As you saw,

00:04:56.984 --> 00:04:58.357
there are so many students here.

00:04:58.667 --> 00:05:00.750
Most of them are nothing
but soft cowards.

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:03.831
Their number doesn't
add to their courage.

00:05:03.868 --> 00:05:05.588
They will only be the monsters' snacks.

00:05:05.921 --> 00:05:09.154
They will never be safe just with
the teachers for protection.

00:05:09.558 --> 00:05:11.038
There are too many students,

00:05:11.282 --> 00:05:13.389
they will attract the
monsters attention.

00:05:13.874 --> 00:05:16.826
If it's one monster,
perhaps we could deal with it,

00:05:17.406 --> 00:05:20.827
but in face of a horde,
we have nothing but our luck to rely on.

00:05:21.094 --> 00:05:22.894
If we are lucky, the others get eaten.

00:05:23.042 --> 00:05:25.307
We get to run away.
If we are not lucky enough...

00:05:25.839 --> 00:05:27.572
Mu Bai, don't be rash.

00:05:27.709 --> 00:05:28.829
We should follow the exodus team.

00:05:29.246 --> 00:05:30.393
Perhaps we could stay alive.

00:05:31.439 --> 00:05:33.110
We have nothing but luck
to rely on if we do that.

00:05:33.353 --> 00:05:35.180
Our destiny is in our own hands.

00:05:35.823 --> 00:05:36.906
Seriously?

00:05:37.072 --> 00:05:38.666
Sir, we are joining too.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.406
What? We?

00:05:40.521 --> 00:05:42.522
-I am not joining!
-Brother Fan.

00:05:42.709 --> 00:05:45.376
How did you manage to calm down
and analyse the situation?

00:05:45.493 --> 00:05:47.506
It's either calming down
or rushing to our death.

00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:50.375
I am not going to let fate
decide the future for me.

00:05:50.829 --> 00:05:52.861
I would rather open the path myself.

00:05:52.931 --> 00:05:55.121
Very well. We are joining
the pioneer too!

00:05:55.207 --> 00:05:55.953
What?

00:06:02.687 --> 00:06:03.487
Mo Fan?

00:06:06.608 --> 00:06:07.566
You are still alive.

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:08.530
Mo Fan?

00:06:12.462 --> 00:06:13.629
Zhou Min, look!

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:15.061
It's Mo Fan, he is alive!

00:06:15.062 --> 00:06:16.103
I know, I can see it.

00:06:16.978 --> 00:06:19.405
I am so glad he is alive.
He never lets me down.

00:06:21.026 --> 00:06:22.549
Nice to see you too.

00:06:22.728 --> 00:06:24.062
Are you all waiting for us?

00:06:24.801 --> 00:06:26.254
It's tough to be hero.

00:06:26.655 --> 00:06:28.069
No one is waiting for you.

00:06:28.852 --> 00:06:30.185
We are waiting for Mo Fan, not you.

00:07:05.119 --> 00:07:05.973
Mr. Yang?

00:07:06.996 --> 00:07:07.889
Are you okay?

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.552
Thanks to you, you made it in time.

00:07:11.933 --> 00:07:13.453
I ran out of stamina.

00:07:13.755 --> 00:07:15.955
Mr. Yang, thank you.

00:07:20.665 --> 00:07:21.745
Black Beasts.

00:07:22.706 --> 00:07:24.279
These talons of Black Curia...

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:27.515
Every member has at least one of these.

00:07:27.972 --> 00:07:28.612
Yes.

00:07:28.887 --> 00:07:31.933
It seems like this crisis is really
what the Black Curia does.

00:07:32.327 --> 00:07:33.154
It must be.

00:07:34.057 --> 00:07:36.466
What are they trying to achieve?

00:07:37.038 --> 00:07:38.171
We don't know about that yet.

00:07:39.962 --> 00:07:43.667
But we can tell the Black Curia is
after the Sacred Spring.

00:07:44.049 --> 00:07:46.049
They plan to use the
massive energy of the Spring...

00:07:46.169 --> 00:07:49.297
to lure the monster commanders
to attack the city.

00:07:49.743 --> 00:07:52.210
Right, did you extract
the Sacred Spring?

00:07:52.277 --> 00:07:54.708
I know the Black Curia want to
get their hands on the Sacred Spring.

00:07:55.022 --> 00:07:56.288
My identity makes me
easy to get spotted.

00:07:56.368 --> 00:07:58.474
So I handed it over the Mo Fan.

00:07:59.009 --> 00:08:00.502
The kid that is born
with Double Talents?

00:08:01.004 --> 00:08:04.611
-Where is he now?
-I think he is headed to the barrier.

00:08:04.935 --> 00:08:07.009
I am not sure about his
exact location either.

00:08:07.056 --> 00:08:08.163
You made the right call.

00:08:08.523 --> 00:08:11.800
They wouldn't notice the Spring
is now with a student.

00:08:12.452 --> 00:08:14.435
But he is just a Star mage,

00:08:14.924 --> 00:08:17.355
it's hard enough for him
to survive the crisis.

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.264
Let's split up.

00:08:19.504 --> 00:08:21.411
-We need to find Mo Fan now.
-Yes.

00:08:35.578 --> 00:08:37.042
Okay, move out!

00:08:37.628 --> 00:08:38.294
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:09:24.036 --> 00:09:25.437
Everyone, it's time to move out.

00:09:44.722 --> 00:09:46.733
This is the protective barrier?

00:09:47.368 --> 00:09:49.518
Mr. Mu Zhuoyun?
Miss Mu Ningxue?

00:09:50.338 --> 00:09:52.303
Is there a doctor here?
My father is hurt.

00:09:52.329 --> 00:09:53.699
Yes, please come with us.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:54.558
Leave him to us.

00:09:55.291 --> 00:09:56.618
Here, watch your steps.

00:09:56.671 --> 00:09:57.902
Watch your steps. Slowly.

00:09:57.956 --> 00:09:59.725
Is there any student from
Sky Magic High School?

00:09:59.868 --> 00:10:00.814
Sky Magic High School?

00:10:01.269 --> 00:10:03.242
I don't think we have seen any of them.

00:10:03.476 --> 00:10:05.729
I don't know anyone that
got through inside the barrier.

00:10:08.435 --> 00:10:09.235
Mo Fan.

00:10:23.601 --> 00:10:25.254
Spread out and scout the area.

00:10:25.764 --> 00:10:26.658
Watch your backs.

00:10:27.761 --> 00:10:28.654
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:10:29.402 --> 00:10:29.989
Yes.

00:10:30.953 --> 00:10:31.673
Yes.

00:10:41.378 --> 00:10:42.831
What? Hey!

00:10:43.078 --> 00:10:45.318
There are two Cyclops
at the news stand.

00:10:46.208 --> 00:10:48.446
Cyclops are nothing to be afraid of.

00:10:54.004 --> 00:10:57.529
That Cyclops is gnawing a kid.

00:10:58.173 --> 00:10:58.821
What?

00:11:02.332 --> 00:11:03.732
-Where is it?
-Over there.

00:11:08.094 --> 00:11:08.984
Where did it go?

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:11.664
Sir, we should search over there.

00:11:11.975 --> 00:11:12.815
We can't just let it loose.

00:11:13.369 --> 00:11:14.614
Sure.

00:11:16.392 --> 00:11:17.954
Those with Wind Talent,
scout the area ahead.

00:11:18.304 --> 00:11:21.287
Stay ahead of us with your speed.
We will follow your lead.

00:11:22.285 --> 00:11:23.290
Sure.

00:11:23.312 --> 00:11:23.865
Understood.

00:11:24.148 --> 00:11:24.775
Stay safe.

00:11:25.495 --> 00:11:26.666
Leave it to me, Brother Fan.

00:11:36.974 --> 00:11:38.829
Wind magic, Haste!

00:11:51.791 --> 00:11:54.415
This is strange, it was here just now.

00:12:15.695 --> 00:12:16.888
Arh!

00:12:26.238 --> 00:12:26.996
Zhang Yinglu?

00:12:31.052 --> 00:12:32.737
Arh!

00:12:33.745 --> 00:12:34.968
-What was that?
-What happened?

00:12:34.969 --> 00:12:36.661
-What is going on here?
-What's the matter?

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:39.101
-Zhang Yinglu!
-Zhang Yinglu!

00:12:39.314 --> 00:12:40.541
-Zhang Yinglu!
-Everyone, on guard.

00:12:40.938 --> 00:12:42.349
Watch out for monsters nearby!

00:12:42.799 --> 00:12:45.370
We need to be quick or we'll die too!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.304
He Yu, there is one behind you!

00:12:53.422 --> 00:12:54.116
What?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:56.580
Die, monster!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.846
Cursed monster, how dare you!

00:13:06.475 --> 00:13:07.713
Xiaohou, follow that monster.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:08.983
Do not let it get away.

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.849
-Avenge Zhang Yinglu!
-Yes.

00:13:11.149 --> 00:13:12.296
I won't let it get away.

00:13:12.867 --> 00:13:14.515
Blinding Radiance!

00:13:17.752 --> 00:13:19.890
-Wow.
-Is it killed?

00:13:20.235 --> 00:13:22.377
Yes, Brother Fan's lightning
stunned it.

00:13:22.608 --> 00:13:24.154
There was no way it
could have got away.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.721
How do you strike them all at once?
They were moving so fast.

00:13:28.008 --> 00:13:29.688
You must not attack where they stand.

00:13:29.821 --> 00:13:31.315
Predict the movement
and lead the aim.

00:13:31.528 --> 00:13:33.690
Keep an eye on their body movement
when you release the magic.

00:13:44.486 --> 00:13:46.373
Someone died as soon as we moved out.

00:13:47.203 --> 00:13:50.117
It's my fault. I didn't see
there was one hiding there.

00:13:50.278 --> 00:13:51.838
I failed to keep Zhang Yinglu safe.

00:13:52.672 --> 00:13:54.165
It's our fault to be so weak.

00:13:54.462 --> 00:13:57.836
When we were attacked by two monsters,
there was nothing we could do.

00:13:59.634 --> 00:14:00.728
Brother Fan?

00:14:01.534 --> 00:14:03.308
The death is the end.

00:14:04.247 --> 00:14:06.768
But those remain alive has a duty.

00:14:07.283 --> 00:14:08.003
Let's go.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.190
It's pointless to stay here anyway.

00:14:21.541 --> 00:14:25.341
I don't want anyone else
to lose her life again.

00:14:29.465 --> 00:14:30.185
Mo Fan,

00:14:30.385 --> 00:14:33.563
you remained calm when
the monster attacked.

00:14:34.073 --> 00:14:36.054
-How did you do that?
-Sir.

00:14:36.441 --> 00:14:38.557
I joined the City Hunters when
I was in my sophomore year.

00:14:38.996 --> 00:14:40.529
I spent two years fighting the monsters.

00:14:40.755 --> 00:14:44.620
But I have never been
surrounded by monsters before.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:45.856
I am afraid as well.

00:14:50.376 --> 00:14:52.189
There are three One-eyed
Wolf Demons ahead.

00:14:52.388 --> 00:14:53.774
One is at the fountain.

00:14:53.927 --> 00:14:55.420
One is in the woods.

00:14:55.678 --> 00:14:58.745
-Another one is at the rockery.
-Are you sure that is all?

00:14:59.328 --> 00:14:59.968
Yes.

00:15:01.144 --> 00:15:04.176
There are only three of them.
We should be able to kill them.

00:15:04.751 --> 00:15:07.460
One-eyed Wolf Demons are much
more formidable than Cyclops.

00:15:08.473 --> 00:15:10.553
Is a One-eyed Wolf Demon
really so terrifying?

00:15:11.014 --> 00:15:12.414
Mo Fan killed one before.

00:15:13.159 --> 00:15:14.572
It was a Warrior.

00:15:15.209 --> 00:15:17.779
Brother Fan was in the City Hunters.

00:15:21.233 --> 00:15:21.887
Xiaohou,

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.498
is the route through the park
the only way out?

00:15:25.476 --> 00:15:27.329
That is the route with least monsters.

00:15:28.253 --> 00:15:28.986
Xiaohou.

00:15:29.413 --> 00:15:30.959
Distract the monster by the fountain.

00:15:31.503 --> 00:15:33.756
Wolf Demon can sprint swiftly
in a straight line.

00:15:34.189 --> 00:15:37.844
It will catch up with you unless
you can use Starchart Wind Magic.

00:15:38.283 --> 00:15:41.534
Try to move around and change your
path as you distract him.

00:15:42.121 --> 00:15:45.443
One-eyed Wolf Demon slows down
when they can't run in straight lines.

00:15:47.299 --> 00:15:50.641
You mean I have to predict
its movement like you did before?

00:15:50.817 --> 00:15:53.155
-Can I even do that?
-Don't be afraid.

00:15:53.288 --> 00:15:55.386
Xiaohou, I believe in you.

00:15:57.023 --> 00:15:58.892
Okay, I get it.

00:16:00.444 --> 00:16:01.058
Yes.

00:16:02.245 --> 00:16:05.281
Mu Bai, stall the monster at the woods
with your Ice Talent magic.

00:16:05.972 --> 00:16:08.119
Do your best to freeze it
and stall its movement.

00:16:08.509 --> 00:16:10.163
It's more effective
to freeze its joints.

00:16:10.869 --> 00:16:12.458
Okay.

00:16:12.847 --> 00:16:15.789
The rest of us will finish off the one
at the rockery as soon as possible.

00:16:16.196 --> 00:16:16.929
With that done,

00:16:17.102 --> 00:16:20.159
it'll greatly reduce the risk as
we take them off one by one.

00:16:20.205 --> 00:16:21.459
Yes, indeed.

00:16:21.507 --> 00:16:23.107
We have two mages with Thunder Talent.

00:16:23.417 --> 00:16:26.293
Even if the Wolf Demons have better
defence than the Cyclops,

00:16:26.479 --> 00:16:27.573
we could still manage to kill them.

00:16:28.758 --> 00:16:31.170
Finish off the first Cyclops.
Then, we take out the other two.

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.440
That is a sound plan.

00:16:33.717 --> 00:16:35.435
If we fight on our own,

00:16:35.634 --> 00:16:37.700
it will be hard to
defeat an adult monster.

00:16:38.153 --> 00:16:40.569
But if we combine magic
from different Talents,

00:16:40.754 --> 00:16:44.318
with enough teamwork, we can
finish them off without casualty!

00:16:46.028 --> 00:16:49.610
You will realize the monsters are not
as terrifying as you thought.

00:16:50.531 --> 00:16:51.211
Yes.

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:53.777
We'll follow your order.

00:16:54.353 --> 00:16:56.472
Yes. We will follow your command.

00:16:56.608 --> 00:16:57.274
Mo Fan.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.653
We are counting on you to keep us alive.

00:17:00.248 --> 00:17:00.822
Sure.

00:17:01.297 --> 00:17:04.094
You united everyone here,
I am glad for it.

00:17:04.488 --> 00:17:06.301
I believe we can make it through this.

00:17:07.113 --> 00:17:07.811
Fighting,everyone.

00:17:08.137 --> 00:17:09.357
We can do this.

00:17:09.358 --> 00:17:10.491
-Fighting.
-We can do it.

00:17:10.653 --> 00:17:11.427
Is that clear?

00:17:12.065 --> 00:17:13.943
Yes, I hope so.

00:17:30.919 --> 00:17:33.294
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:33.997 --> 00:17:37.407
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:37.677 --> 00:17:40.728
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:41.369 --> 00:17:42.849
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.143
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:45.757 --> 00:17:48.803
♪ Dreamt that we will
not wander anymore ♪

00:17:49.135 --> 00:17:53.060
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:54.547 --> 00:17:58.472
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:59.451 --> 00:18:04.398
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:18:05.459 --> 00:18:08.720
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:18:09.032 --> 00:18:11.886
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:18:12.153 --> 00:18:14.478
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:18:14.621 --> 00:18:17.529
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:18:17.854 --> 00:18:20.576
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:18:20.711 --> 00:18:24.128
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:18:24.454 --> 00:18:26.423
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:26.995 --> 00:18:30.092
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:30.637 --> 00:18:34.476
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:35.064 --> 00:18:41.301
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
